<item>
<title>Iran and the regional confrontation: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/iran/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-iran-2026-11-08T23:50:40.077Z</guid>
<pubDate>Sun, 08 Nov 2026 23:50:40 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Iran launched a missile that struck a building in Tel Aviv while the United States carried out fresh strikes on Iran's Qeshm Island and disabled a commercial vessel attempting to run a blockade in the Gulf of Oman. The IRGC announced that its self-imposed limit on ballistic-missile range has been lifted and that it is building underground sites for weapons production and storage. Tehran delivered a secret Khamenei message to Putin as Moscow pushes a gas-pipeline deal and sent a nuclear proposal to the United States via Qatar. Houthis damaged the Saudi Aramco tower in Riyadh, and 123 battle-related deaths occurred in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.washingtonpost.com/national-security/2026/11/08/us-offers-20-million-reward-information-iran-nuclear-program/&quot;&gt;The Washington Post&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.bbc.co.uk/news/articles/ckly0ex633ydo?at_medium=RSS&amp;amp;at_campaign=rss&quot;&gt;BBC News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.aljazeera.com/video/newsfeed/2026/11/8/iran-waiting-to-resume-talks-after-us-midterms-shockiranian-foreign-minis?traffic_source=rss&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.euronews.com/2026/11/07/us-launches-new-targeted-strikes-on-iran-as-trump-claims-progress-in-talks-with-tehran&quot;&gt;Euronews&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.theguardian.com/world/2026/nov/07/strait-of-hormuz-qatar-plan-iran-nuclear-inspections&quot;&gt;The Guardian&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.euronews.com/2026/11/06/iran-delivers-secret-khamenei-message-to-putin-as-moscow-pushes-gas-pipeline-deal&quot;&gt;Euronews&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.nytimes.com/2026/11/05/world/middleeast/peace-talks-iran-united-states-qatar-nuclear-program.html&quot;&gt;The New York Times&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.aljazeera.com/news/2026/11/8/iran-threatens-to-rain-down-hell-if-us-escalates-war&quot;&gt;aljazeera.com&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMitAFBVV95cUxQZzA3VUJ1UWpnaXNfMkt1RFJGUWxuRG5EX3VsRWJBVngwNVJETXBfS1dUUGFZel9lMEJIdi10dFNlZWduc1ZSOU50bTBfbXVyLUpaQ2EzSmpXSWZGM2pNcFJJaFExVWhDTmxVSnc0TWozMTc5T1lhSHIwU2hTVU1XSzdYU3dDQldWZ2dRS012TUpsSFRBSmJjcEtRbkFIU09NMkFORGpxanpXaXhIVF81TzZoSTE?oc=5&quot;&gt;Bloomberg&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</description>
